itment.\n- **Workload Balance**: Inconsistent velocity indicates possible capacity misalignment.\n\n**Recommendation**: Conduct a capacity planning session to better align workload with team capacity. Consider cross-training to improve flexibility.\n\n## General Recommendations\n- **Process Efficiency**: \n  - Implement regular retrospectives to identify and address process bottlenecks.\n  - Enhance collaboration tools and practices to improve communication and efficiency.\n- **Monitoring and Reporting**: \n  - Establish dashboards for real-time monitoring of key metrics (e.g., ticket resolution times, sprint velocity).\n  - Schedule regular reviews to ensure alignment with strategic goals.",
